{
  "id": "domestic_hot_water_service_systems___design_proced",
  "title": "Domestic Hot Water Service Systems - Design Procedures",
  "description": "A comprehensive guide for designing hot water service systems, including demand calculation, calorifier selection, boiler sizing, and pipe design procedures.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Consumer",
        "Temperature (°C)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Showers",
          43
        ],
        [
          "Lavatory - hand washing",
          40
        ],
        [
          "Lavatory - shaving",
          45
        ],
        [
          "Tubs",
          43
        ],
        [
          "Therapeutic baths",
          35
        ],
        [
          "Laundry, commercial",
          "up to 82"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "id": "accumulator_heat_supply",
      "content": "## Maximum Heat Supply to Accumulator\n\nCalculate the heat (power) supply required to heat an accumulator tank.\n\n**Formula:** H = cp × V × (q2 - q1) / t",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "volume",
          "label": "Accumulator Volume",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "liters",
          "defaultValue": 200
        },
        {
          "id": "temp_cold",
          "label": "Cold Feed Water Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "temp_hot",
          "label": "Hot Water Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 50
        },
        {
          "id": "heating_time",
          "label": "Heating Time",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "hours",
          "defaultValue": 5.5
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "heat_supply",
          "label": "Required Heat Supply",
          "formula": "(4.19 * inputs.volume * (inputs.temp_hot - inputs.temp_cold)) / (inputs.heating_time * 3600)",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "id": "accumulator_volume",
      "content": "## Accumulator Volume Required\n\nCalculate the required accumulated volume based on available heat supply and heating time.\n\n**Formula:** V = Ha × ta / (cp × (q2 - q1))",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "heat_available",
          "label": "Available Heat Supply",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kW",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "heating_time_avail",
          "label": "Available Heating Time",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "hours",
          "defaultValue": 8
        },
        {
          "id": "temp_cold_vol",
          "label": "Cold Feed Water Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "temp_hot_vol",
          "label": "Hot Water Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 50
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "accumulator_vol",
          "label": "Required Accumulator Volume",
          "formula": "(inputs.heat_available * inputs.heating_time_avail * 3600) / (4.19 * (inputs.temp_hot_vol - inputs.temp_cold_vol))",
          "unit": "liters",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "id": "continuous_heating_power",
      "content": "## Required Power for Continuous Water Heating\n\nCalculate the heat supply required for instantaneous heating with no accumulation.\n\n**Formula:** H = cp × v × (q2 - q1)",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "volume_flow",
          "label": "Required Volume Flow",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "liters/s",
          "defaultValue": 0.05
        },
        {
          "id": "temp_cold_cont",
          "label": "Cold Feed Water Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "temp_hot_cont",
          "label": "Hot Water Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 50
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "heating_power",
          "label": "Required Heating Power",
          "formula": "4.19 * inputs.volume_flow * (inputs.temp_hot_cont - inputs.temp_cold_cont)",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "id": "heating_surface",
      "content": "## Required Heating Surface Area\n\nCalculate the required heating surface of a heat exchanger.\n\n**Formula:** A = 1000 × H / (k × q_m)",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "heat_rate",
          "label": "Rate of Heating",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kW",
          "defaultValue": 10
        },
        {
          "id": "heat_coeff",
          "label": "Overall Heat Transmission Coefficient",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "W/m²K",
          "defaultValue": 2000
        },
        {
          "id": "mean_temp_diff",
          "label": "Logarithmic Mean Temperature Difference",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "K",
          "defaultValue": 20
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "heating_area",
          "label": "Required Heating Surface Area",
          "formula": "(1000 * inputs.heat_rate) / (inputs.heat_coeff * inputs.mean_temp_diff)",
          "unit": "m²",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}